<div>
  <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Rename a tag</h3>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
    Renaming changes the tag on every post that uses it. Double-click a tag name to start editing, or use the pencil.
  </p>
</div>

<div>
  <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Merge two tags</h3>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
    Rename a tag to match one that already exists and the two become a single tag.
  </p>
</div>

<div>
  <h3 class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Delete a tag</h3>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
    Deleting removes the tag from every post that uses it. The posts themselves are untouched.
  </p>
</div>
